<title>LIECHTENSTEIN: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>LIECHTENSTEIN GOVERNMENT LIST (970414)</p>
<p>  Head of State.............Prince HANS ADAM II</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT (Formed 14 April 97, four year term)</p>
<p>  Head of Government...........Mario FRICK (VU)</p>
<p>(Responsible for Finance, Construction)</p>
<p>Deputy Head of Government.Michael RITTER (VU)</p>
<p>(Responsible for Home Affairs, Health &amp; Social,</p>
<p>	 and Economics)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p>Education, Environment, Transport........Norbert MARXER (VU)</p>
<p>Foreign Affairs, Family, Culture &amp; Sport...Andrea WILLI (VU)</p>
<p>Justice....Heinz FROMMELT (VU)</p>
<p>			 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>VU  -- Fatherland Union (Vaterlandische Union)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>State Bank Chairman............Karlheinz HEEB</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			  (End Government List)</p>
